      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Simon-yyy/dsh-theme-escook/main/assets/logo.svg\" width=\"96\" alt=\"escook-theme logo\" />\n</p>\n\n<h3 align=\"center\">🌸 Escook Theme for DeepSeek Harness</h3>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  A premium dark violet & amber gold aesthetic theme crafted for DeepSeek Harness Web GUI & Desktop.\n</p>"
